# Refer projects under references/

`references/` is **read-only** inspiration. It is gitignored; `.cursorignore` still allows Read, Grep, and Glob. Do not copy files, ports, env layout, or product behavior into `admin/` or `api/` unless the user asks.

Stay in the **single** BrainPulses v2.0 folder workspace. Do not ask the user to add `references` as a second workspace root (that splits chat history).

When the user says **refer**, **look at**, **from**, or **like** one of these projects, search and read **only** that folder for that task:

| User says | Path |
|---|---|
| PGDM, DISHA, Induction, PGDM Induction | `references/PGDM Induction Program/` |
| LevelUP, Level Up | `references/LevelUP/` |
| legacy BrainPulses, old BrainPulses, brainpulses (reference) | `references/brainpulses/` |

```text
❌ BAD — Grep the whole repo or invent paths under reference-projects/
✅ GOOD — Grep path references/LevelUP for the pattern the task needs
```

- Prefer `path` scoped to the matching folder. Pass absolute paths when the tool needs them.
- Other roots under `references/` (`ChatGPT/`, `design-systems/`, HTML mocks) only when the user names them.
- Ideas only. Implement in this app’s stack and conventions. Never commit `references/`.
